msgid "Use multicast routing (instead of tunneling)"
msgstr "Uporabi usmerjanje multicast (namesto tuneliranja)"

msgid "Gateway IP"
msgstr "IP prehoda"

msgid "An open connection to the gateway connects to the new address once it is entered."
msgstr "Odprta povezava s prehodom se poveže z novim naslovom, takoj ko je vnesen."

msgid "Use the Project's Bus Connection"
msgstr "Uporabi povezavo z vodilom iz projekta"

msgid "While a project is open whose backbone line has a Bus Connection (Topology), the connection goes through it instead of the gateway set here."
msgstr "Dokler je odprt projekt, katerega hrbtenična linija ima povezavo z vodilom (Topologija), povezava poteka prek nje namesto prek tukaj nastavljenega prehoda."

msgid "Multicast Group"
msgstr "Skupina multicast"

msgid "Apply"
msgstr "Uporabi"

msgid "Connect at Startup"
msgstr "Poveži ob zagonu"

msgid "At start, the editor looks for KNX interfaces and connects to the one used last. Turned off, it connects only when you choose."
msgstr "Ob zagonu urejevalnik poišče vmesnike KNX in se poveže z nazadnje uporabljenim. Če je izklopljeno, se poveže le, ko to izberete."

msgid "Block Bus Writes"
msgstr "Blokiraj pisanje na vodilo"

msgid "Reads only: nothing that would change something on the bus is sent, such as downloads, address changes, restarts or group writes. This holds for MCP clients too, which can turn it on but not off. Reads of KNX Data Secure devices are blocked as well."
msgstr "Samo branje: ne pošlje se nič, kar bi kaj spremenilo na vodilu, na primer programiranje, spremembe naslovov, ponovni zagoni ali skupinski zapisi. To velja tudi za odjemalce MCP, ki ga lahko vklopijo, ne pa izklopijo. Blokirano je tudi branje naprav KNX Data Secure."

msgid "Bus writes blocked"
msgstr "Pisanje na vodilo blokirano"

msgid "Block Bus Writes is on: the editor reads from the bus but changes nothing there. Click to change it in the settings."
msgstr "Blokiranje pisanja na vodilo je vklopljeno: urejevalnik bere z vodila, a na njem ničesar ne spremeni. Kliknite, da to spremenite v nastavitvah."

msgid "Use Serial Number for Downloads"
msgstr "Pri programiranju uporabi serijsko številko"

msgid "Bus monitor: {ip}"
msgstr "Monitor vodila: {ip}"

msgid "The gateway is connected in bus monitor mode. Nothing can be sent or downloaded until the bus monitor is stopped."
msgstr "Prehod je povezan v načinu monitorja vodila. Dokler monitorja vodila ne ustavite, ni mogoče ničesar poslati ali programirati."

msgid "Stop Bus Monitor"
msgstr "Ustavi monitor vodila"

msgid "Not possible while the bus monitor is running"
msgstr "Ni mogoče, dokler deluje monitor vodila"

msgid "Answered the scan, but reading its details failed: {error}"
msgstr "Naprava se je odzvala na iskanje, vendar branje njenih podrobnosti ni uspelo: {error}"

