msgstr "Fizični naslov"

msgid "Address Free?"
msgstr "Naslov Prost?"

msgid "The individual address {address} is not used by another device."
msgstr "Fizičnega naslova {address} ne uporablja nobena druga naprava."

msgid "The individual address {address} is already in use by another device on the bus."
msgstr "Fizični naslov {address} že uporablja druga naprava na vodilu."

msgid "{address} is not an individual address (area.line.device)."
msgstr "{address} ni fizični naslov (področje.linija.naprava)."

msgid "The individual address of the interface is being set or checked."
msgstr "Fizični naslov vmesnika se nastavlja ali preverja."

msgid "Not connected through a USB interface."
msgstr "Ni povezave prek vmesnika USB."

msgid "The individual address could not be set: {error}"
msgstr "Fizičnega naslova ni bilo mogoče nastaviti: {error}"

msgid "The individual address could not be checked: {error}"
msgstr "Fizičnega naslova ni bilo mogoče preveriti: {error}"

msgid "Setting the individual address…"
msgstr "Nastavljanje fizičnega naslova…"

msgid "Checking the individual address on the bus…"
msgstr "Preverjanje fizičnega naslova na vodilu…"

msgid "This interface forgets its individual address when unplugged, so it is set again on every connect."
msgstr "Ta vmesnik ob odklopu pozabi svoj fizični naslov, zato se nastavi znova ob vsaki povezavi."

msgid "Protected Group Addresses"
msgstr "Zaščiteni Skupinski Naslovi"

msgid "Nothing is ever sent to these group addresses, not even reads, e.g. the ones of gates or an alarm system: addresses like 1/2/3, or groups ending with a slash like 7/0/, separated by spaces. MCP clients can add to the list but not take anything out."
msgstr "Na te skupinske naslove se nikoli nič ne pošlje, niti branja, npr. naslovi vrat ali alarmnega sistema: naslovi, kot je 1/2/3, ali skupine, ki se končajo s poševnico, kot je 7/0/, ločeni s presledki. Odjemalci MCP lahko seznam dopolnijo, ne morejo pa ničesar odstraniti."

msgid "Not a group address or group: {entries}"
msgstr "Ni skupinski naslov ali skupina: {entries}"

msgid "Confirmation Timeout (Seconds)"
msgstr "Časovna omejitev potrditve (sekunde)"

msgid "How long to wait for the interface to confirm each frame it sends. A slow connection, such as a remote tunnel or a VPN, needs longer."
msgstr "Kako dolgo se čaka, da vmesnik potrdi vsak okvir, ki ga pošlje. Počasna povezava, na primer oddaljeni tunel ali VPN, potrebuje več časa."

msgid "Acknowledgement Timeout (Seconds)"
msgstr "Časovna omejitev potrditve prejema (sekunde)"

msgid "How long to wait for a device to acknowledge a frame of a download before sending it again (up to three times). A device closes the connection after 6 seconds without a frame, so a longer wait only helps where the answers are late, not lost."
msgstr "Kako dolgo se čaka, da naprava potrdi okvir programiranja, preden se pošlje znova (do trikrat). Naprava zapre povezavo po 6 sekundah brez okvirja, zato daljše čakanje pomaga le, ko odgovori pridejo pozno, ne ko se izgubijo."

msgid "Response Timeout (Seconds)"
msgstr "Časovna omejitev odgovora (sekunde)"

msgid "How long to wait for a device's answer, e.g. to a memory or property read."
msgstr "Kako dolgo se čaka na odgovor naprave, npr. na branje pomnilnika ali lastnosti."

msgid "Medium: {medium}"
msgstr "Medij: {medium}"

msgid "Domain Address"
msgstr "Naslov domene"

msgid "From Line"
msgstr "Iz linije"

msgid "The interface sends with this domain address and receives only the telegrams of devices with it."
msgstr "Vmesnik oddaja s tem naslovom domene in sprejema le telegrame naprav, ki ga imajo."

msgid "{address} is not an RF domain address (4 and 8 hexadecimal digits, e.g. 0001:23456789)."
msgstr "{address} ni naslov domene RF (4 in 8 šestnajstiških števk, npr. 0001:23456789)."

msgid "The domain address of the interface is being set."
msgstr "Naslov domene vmesnika se nastavlja."

msgid "The connected USB interface is not a KNX RF interface."
msgstr "Povezani vmesnik USB ni vmesnik KNX RF."

msgid "The domain address could not be set: {error}"
msgstr "Naslova domene ni bilo mogoče nastaviti: {error}"

msgid "Setting the domain address…"
msgstr "Nastavljanje naslova domene…"

msgid "Local Device Access"
msgstr "Dostop do lokalne naprave"

msgid "Connects to the KNX device the USB interface is part of (e.g. an actuator with a USB port of its own) instead of the bus. Only this device can then be reached, for downloads and readouts; group telegrams, broadcasts and the bus monitor are not available. Needs a cEMI interface."
msgstr "Namesto z vodilom se poveže z napravo KNX, katere del je vmesnik USB (npr. aktuator z lastnimi vrati USB). Takrat je dosegljiva samo ta naprava, za prenose in branja; skupinski telegrami, oddajanja in monitor vodila niso na voljo. Zahteva vmesnik cEMI."

msgid "Connect to the interface's own device (local device access)"
msgstr "Poveži z lastno napravo vmesnika (dostop do lokalne naprave)"

msgid "{target}, local device access to {address}"
msgstr "{target}, dostop do lokalne naprave {address}"

msgid "(address unknown)"
msgstr "(naslov neznan)"

msgid "Local device access: only this device is reached"
msgstr "Dostop do lokalne naprave: dosegljiva je samo ta naprava"

msgid "Switching the connection…"
msgstr "Preklapljanje povezave…"

msgid "The connection could not be switched: {error}"
msgstr "Povezave ni bilo mogoče preklopiti: {error}"

msgid "The connection of the interface is being switched."
msgstr "Povezava vmesnika se preklaplja."

msgid "Through local device access only the USB interface's own device {local} can be reached, not {address}."
msgstr "Prek dostopa do lokalne naprave je dosegljiva samo lastna naprava {local} vmesnika USB, ne {address}."

msgid "Through local device access only the USB interface's own device {local} can be reached: group telegrams can't be sent."
msgstr "Prek dostopa do lokalne naprave je dosegljiva samo lastna naprava {local} vmesnika USB: skupinskih telegramov ni mogoče pošiljati."

msgid "Through local device access only the USB interface's own device {local} can be reached: broadcasts can't be sent."
msgstr "Prek dostopa do lokalne naprave je dosegljiva samo lastna naprava {local} vmesnika USB: oddajanj ni mogoče pošiljati."

msgid "Through local device access only the USB interface's own device {local} can be reached: the bus monitor can't run."
msgstr "Prek dostopa do lokalne naprave je dosegljiva samo lastna naprava {local} vmesnika USB: monitor vodila ne more delovati."

msgid "Through local device access only the USB interface's own device {local} can be reached: scan from {local} to {local}."
msgstr "Prek dostopa do lokalne naprave je dosegljiva samo lastna naprava {local} vmesnika USB: preiščite od {local} do {local}."

msgid "Protocol"
msgstr "Protokol"

msgid "KNXnet/IP Server"
msgstr "Strežnik KNXnet/IP"

msgid "Run a KNXnet/IP server for other tools (USB to IP bridge)"
msgstr "Zaženi strežnik KNXnet/IP za druga orodja (most USB v IP)"

msgid "Other tools (another editor, Home Assistant, a commissioning tool) connect to it over the network and use this USB interface as a KNXnet/IP interface. Each tunnel gets one of the tunnel addresses, which have to be free addresses of the interface's line. It runs while the editor is connected to the bus through the interface, and opens a network port: turn it on only where that is wanted."
msgstr "Druga orodja (drug urejevalnik, Home Assistant, orodje za zagon) se z njim povežejo prek omrežja in ta vmesnik USB uporabljajo kot vmesnik KNXnet/IP. Vsak tunel dobi enega od naslovov tunelov, ki morajo biti prosti naslovi linije vmesnika. Deluje, dokler je urejevalnik prek vmesnika povezan z vodilom, in odpre omrežna vrata: vklopite ga samo tam, kjer je to zaželeno."

